Provenance of the bundled executables (SHA-256)
-----------------------------------------------

The Linux and Windows executables are byte-for-byte identical to the
precompiled binaries in the upstream archive's Precompiled_binaries/ directory:

  Linux64/SAINTexpress-spc       03b0d5c929bf9634c29fba2d25f13a89c9a7531a3d78e31c7066d4f78fe349a0
  Linux64/SAINTexpress-int       30c41368319ff8470305d4b321382296f7a0e498b4515016c0434caed1a44ad0
  Windows64/SAINTexpress-spc.exe bff7530721c983d3a14123dc8b5d38b697026485f6e9a3da8d9fed27d9953b2b
  Windows64/SAINTexpress-int.exe c823b4a970efb06bf1ff2698eb567286e4120aa9ac4205e9f6c55d3b7b55b5d0

The upstream archive contains no macOS binaries. The executables in
inst/bin/Darwin/ were compiled locally by the maintainer from the same upstream
archive and are covered by the same GPL-3-or-later terms.

